### Shelf Integration Test - Manual HTTP Testing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminToken = <replace with actual admin token>
@sectionId = <replace with actual section ID>

### 1. Get Shelf Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/stats

### 2. Get Available Shelves
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/available

### 3. Get Shelves by Category - Electronics
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/category/Electronics

### 4. Get Shelves by Category - Food
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/category/Food

### 5. Get Shelf Capacity
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/{{shelfId}}/capacity

### 6. Create New Shelf
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shelf_number": 101,
  "section_id": "{{sectionId}}",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "capacity": 100,
  "current_load": 0,
  "is_full": false
}

### 7. Create Shelf - Duplicate Number (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shelf_number": 101,
  "section_id": "{{sectionId}}",
  "category": "Food",
  "capacity": 150,
  "current_load": 0
}

### Save Shelf ID for Further Tests
@shelfId = <replace with actual shelf ID>

### 8. Toggle Shelf Full Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shelves/{{shelfId}}/toggle-full
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. Toggle Shelf Full Status Again
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shelves/{{shelfId}}/toggle-full
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 10. Update Shelf - Change Capacity
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shelves/{{shelfId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 120
}

### 11. Update Shelf - Change Category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shelves/{{shelfId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Premium Electronics"
}

### 12. Delete Shelf
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shelves/{{shelfId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Bulk Create Shelves
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shelf_number": 201,
  "section_id": "{{sectionId}}",
  "category": "Food",
  "capacity": 150,
  "current_load": 50,
  "is_full": false
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shelf_number": 202,
  "section_id": "{{sectionId}}",
  "category": "Food",
  "capacity": 150,
  "current_load": 150,
  "is_full": true
}

### 14. Get All Shelves with Current Load
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves

### 15. Test Shelf Near Capacity
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/category/Food

### 16. Get Shelf Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/{{shelfId}}
